| !Run for !PlexRO (a Plex client that plays through ReelEGL or Reel)
| Puts PlexRO on the icon bar: Select on it to sign in, or to browse your
| Plex server. Videos are played by ReelEGL (or Reel), from riscos-ffmpeg.
Set PlexRO$Dir <Obey$Dir>
IconSprites <PlexRO$Dir>.!Sprites

RMEnsure SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 IfThere System:Modules.SharedULib Then RMLoad System:Modules.SharedULib
RMEnsure SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 Error PlexRO needs SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 or later. Install it with PackMan.
RMEnsure ARMEABISupport 0 IfThere System:Modules.ARMEABISupport Then RMLoad System:Modules.ARMEABISupport
RMEnsure ARMEABISupport 0 Error PlexRO needs the ARMEABISupport module. Install it with PackMan.
| Threads: the thread timer of UnixLib 5.0.1 and later (which PlexRO is built with)
| runs from the PThreadTicker module when it's loaded: a copy merged into
| !System first, else the one in here. Without it UnixLib uses a copy in
| the RMA, which also works.
RMEnsure PThreadTicker 0.01 IfThere System:Modules.PThrTicker Then RMLoad System:Modules.PThrTicker
RMEnsure PThreadTicker 0.01 IfThere <PlexRO$Dir>.PThrTicker Then RMLoad <PlexRO$Dir>.PThrTicker
| https (plex.tv, and servers' plex.direct addresses): RISC OS's AcornSSL
| module (RISC OS 5.28 or later); quiet if it's missing (then signing in
| with a code says so, and only a server's own http address works)
RMEnsure AcornSSL 0 IfThere System:Modules.Network.URL.AcornSSL Then RMLoad System:Modules.Network.URL.AcornSSL

| The program is about 28MB (FFmpeg's network code comes with its format
| and codec lists); the posters are kept in a dynamic area ("PlexRO Heap").
WimpSlot -min 36864K -max 36864K
Run <PlexRO$Dir>.!RunImage %*0
